<div class="modal fade invoice-finance-modal" id="invoiceFinanceModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="invoiceFinanceTitle" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable"><div class="modal-content border-0 rounded-4 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="modal-header"><div><h5 class="modal-title" id="invoiceFinanceTitle">Invoice finance & payments</h5><div id="invoiceFinanceSubtitle" class="small mt-1"></div></div><button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button></div>
    <div class="modal-body p-4"><div id="invoiceFinanceLoading" role="status">Loading finance records...</div><div id="invoiceFinanceContent" hidden>
        <div id="invoiceFinanceKpis" class="invoice-finance-kpis mb-3"></div>
        <div id="invoiceFinanceLegacy" class="alert alert-warning small" hidden>This invoice was previously marked Paid without a complete receipt breakdown. Record its historical customer/bank split before saving finance tracking. Do not record these amounts as a new collection.</div>
        <div id="financeMasterEditor" class="invoice-finance-section mb-3" hidden><h6 id="financeMasterTitle">Add bank</h6><label for="financeMasterName" class="form-label">Name</label><div class="d-flex gap-2"><input id="financeMasterName" class="form-control" maxlength="255"><button type="button" id="financeMasterSave" class="btn btn-dark-blue">Save</button><button type="button" id="financeMasterCancel" class="btn btn-outline-dark-blue">Cancel</button></div><div id="financeMasterError" class="small text-danger mt-2" role="alert"></div></div>
        <form id="invoiceFinanceForm" novalidate>
            <input type="hidden" name="request_key">
            <div class="invoice-finance-section mb-3"><h6>1. Who will pay this invoice?</h6><p class="small text-muted">Set the customer contribution and bank loan separately. Each can be received in multiple installments.</p><div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label" for="finance-funding">Funding type</label><select id="finance-funding" name="funding_type" class="form-select"><option value="customer">Customer funded</option><option value="bank">Customer + bank loan</option></select></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label" for="finance-down">Planned customer advance / down payment</label><input id="finance-down" name="down_payment" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" class="form-control" value="0"><div class="small text-muted mt-1">A plan only. Record actual receipts below.</div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-bank"><label class="form-label" for="finance-loan">Total bank loan for this invoice</label><input id="finance-loan" name="bank_amount" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" class="form-control" value="0"></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-bank"><label class="form-label" for="finance-bank-name">Bank name</label><div class="d-flex gap-2"><select id="finance-bank-name" name="bank_name" class="form-select"><option value="">Select bank</option></select><button type="button" class="btn btn-dark-blue" data-add-finance-master="bank" aria-label="Add bank">+</button></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-bank"><label class="form-label" for="finance-branch">Branch</label><div class="d-flex gap-2"><select id="finance-branch" name="branch_name" class="form-select"><option value="">Select branch</option></select><button type="button" class="btn btn-dark-blue" data-add-finance-master="branch" aria-label="Add branch">+</button></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-bank"><label class="form-label" for="finance-loan-ref">Loan / application reference</label><input id="finance-loan-ref" name="loan_reference" maxlength="255" class="form-control"></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-bank"><label class="form-label" for="finance-expected">Expected bank disbursement</label><input id="finance-expected" name="expected_bank_date" type="date" class="form-control"></div>
            </div></div>
            <div class="invoice-finance-section"><h6>2. Record an actual payment</h6><div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label" for="finance-action">What are you saving?</label><select id="finance-action" name="action" class="form-select"><option value="plan">Funding plan only</option><option value="payment">Record a payment</option></select></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-payment"><label class="form-label" for="finance-settlement">Payment coverage</label><select id="finance-settlement" name="settlement" class="form-select"><option value="partial">Installment / partial payment</option><option value="full">Full payment / final settlement</option></select></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-payment"><label class="form-label" for="finance-payment-date">Date received</label><input id="finance-payment-date" name="payment_date" type="date" class="form-control"></div>
                <div class="col-12 finance-payment finance-bank"><div class="finance-disbursement-tools"><div><strong>Bank disbursement</strong><p class="small text-muted mb-2">Initial release is a percentage of the total loan. Later, use Remaining bank balance or enter any amount.</p></div><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark-blue btn-sm" data-bank-release="60">Initial 60%</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark-blue btn-sm" data-bank-release="70">Initial 70%</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark-blue btn-sm" data-bank-release="80">Initial 80%</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-dark-blue btn-sm" data-bank-release="remaining">Remaining bank balance</button></div><div id="financeBankReleaseHint" class="small text-muted mt-2"></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 finance-payment"><label class="form-label" for="finance-customer-now">Received from customer now</label><input id="finance-customer-now" name="customer_received_now" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" class="form-control" value="0"><button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm px-0" id="financeFillCustomer">Use remaining customer balance</button></div>
                <div class="col-md-6 finance-payment finance-bank"><label class="form-label" for="finance-bank-now">Received from bank now</label><input id="finance-bank-now" name="bank_received_now" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" class="form-control" value="0"></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-payment"><label class="form-label" for="finance-method">Customer payment method</label><select id="finance-method" name="payment_method" class="form-select"><option value="bank_transfer">Bank transfer</option><option value="upi">UPI</option><option value="cash">Cash</option><option value="cheque">Cheque</option><option value="card">Card</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-payment"><label class="form-label" for="finance-customer-ref">Customer transaction reference</label><input id="finance-customer-ref" name="customer_reference" maxlength="255" class="form-control"></div>
                <div class="col-md-4 finance-payment finance-bank"><label class="form-label" for="finance-bank-ref">Bank disbursement reference</label><input id="finance-bank-ref" name="bank_reference" maxlength="255" class="form-control"></div>
                <div class="col-12"><label class="form-label" for="finance-notes">Remarks / finance notes</label><textarea id="finance-notes" name="notes" maxlength="4000" rows="2" class="form-control"></textarea></div>
            </div><p class="small text-muted mt-3 mb-0">Only actual receipts reduce the balance. Loan approval and the funding plan do not count as money received.</p></div>
            <div id="financePaymentPreview" class="invoice-finance-section mt-3" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </form>
        <div class="mt-4"><h6 class="fw-bold">Payment ledger</h6><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table align-middle small"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Source</th><th>Amount</th><th>Method / reference</th><th>Record</th></tr></thead><tbody id="invoiceFinanceReceipts"></tbody></table></div></div>
        <details class="invoice-finance-section mt-3"><summary class="fw-semibold">Finance audit history</summary><div id="invoiceFinanceEvents" class="mt-3"></div></details>
    </div><div id="invoiceFinanceError" class="text-danger small mt-3" role="alert"></div></div>
    <div class="modal-footer"><a href="{{ route('invoices.receivables') }}" class="btn btn-outline-dark-blue me-auto">Receivables report</a><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark-blue" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-dark-blue" id="invoiceFinanceSave">Save finance details</button></div>
</div></div></div>
